1
00:00:00,053 --> 00:00:02,353
(Howard:)She arranged for us to get a rental car.

2
00:00:02,555 --> 00:00:04,455
(Raj:)Great, we can still make it to Comic-Con.

3
00:00:04,691 --> 00:00:08,061
(Leonard:)Are you kidding me? After all we've
been through? I just want to go home.

4
00:00:08,261 --> 00:00:11,351
(Raj:)Don't be like that.
Come on, Howard, talk to him.

5
00:00:11,564 --> 00:00:14,324
(Howard:)I'm with Leonard. I'm done.

6
00:00:14,534 --> 00:00:18,404
(Raj:)Fine, then I guess it's two against two.
How do we decide?

7
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,230
(Sheldon:)Actually, it's three against one.

8
00:00:22,742 --> 00:00:26,542
What? Well, what about the mission?
You said we're a real-life landing party.

9
00:00:26,746 --> 00:00:28,336
(Sheldon:)Well, we're not.

10
00:00:28,548 --> 00:00:31,038
(Sheldon:)We're an imaginary landing party.

11
00:00:31,251 --> 00:00:36,151
(Sheldon:)Who had real-life garbage thrown at us
by real-life strangers who think we're idiots.

12
00:00:36,956 --> 00:00:39,616
(Sheldon:)And to tell you the truth,
I'm starting to feel like one.

13
00:00:40,427 --> 00:00:42,357
(Sheldon:)I want to go home now.

14
00:00:43,863 --> 00:00:45,293
(Penny:)Okay.

15
00:00:45,899 --> 00:00:48,729
(Raj:)Did we at least rent the car
from Enterprise?

16
00:00:51,805 --> 00:00:53,775
Get it? Enterprise? Heh.

17
00:00:55,275 --> 00:01:00,025
(Raj:)Screw you, that's funny.

